---

---

<section id="security" class="relative py-24 md:py-32" aria-labelledby="security-heading">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="ink-reveal text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary/70 mb-4">
        Enterprise-grade security
      </p>
      <h2 id="security-heading" class="ink-reveal text-debossed text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground leading-[1.15] md:text-4xl">
        Nothing leaves your inbox without your click.
      </h2>
      <p class="ink-reveal mt-6 text-muted-foreground md:text-lg leading-relaxed" style="--reveal-delay: 120">
        Marker is built so the answer to "can I install this without IT" is yes. Inbox data is encrypted in transit and at rest, used to make your Marker smarter, and you can delete it from your account any time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-px md:grid-cols-3 security-grid">
      <div class="ink-reveal security-pillar" style="--reveal-delay: 200">
        <div class="security-pillar-number">1</div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Drafts in your voice, queued for your review</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Marker installs as a sidebar in Gmail and Outlook. We draft replies in your voice and queue them for your review — Marker never sends anything on your behalf.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ink-reveal security-pillar" style="--reveal-delay: 300">
        <div class="security-pillar-number">2</div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Encrypted, and yours to control</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Inbox data is encrypted in transit and at rest. We use it to personalize your Marker — your tone, your suppliers, your styles — and to make the product better over time for you. Delete everything from your account, any time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ink-reveal security-pillar" style="--reveal-delay: 400">
        <div class="security-pillar-number">3</div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Revoke any time</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          One click to revoke access from your Google or Microsoft admin. Account deletion is self-serve. We comply with SOC 2 and ISO 27001 controls — see our Trust Center for current state.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ink-reveal mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6" style="--reveal-delay: 500">
      <div class="security-badge">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" />
        </svg>
        <span>SOC 2 Type II in progress</span>
      </div>
      <div class="security-badge">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" />
        </svg>
        <span>ISO 27001 in progress</span>
      </div>
      <a href="https://trust.onmarker.com/" class="security-badge security-badge--link">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25" />
        </svg>
        <span>Trust Center</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .security-grid {
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #E8DFD0;
    background: #E8DFD0;
  }

  .security-pillar {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    background: #FAF6F0;
  }

  .security-pillar-number {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #3A7D56;
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
    box-shadow:
      0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5),
      inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2),
      inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .security-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground, #7D6B4F);
  }

  .security-badge--link {
    color: var(--primary, #3A7D56);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .security-badge--link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
